{{wikipedia}}
==English==

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|head=[[new|New]] [[York]] [[city|City]]}}

# [[New York, New York]], the largest city in the [[United States of America]]. It consists of five [[borough]]s: [[Manhattan]], the [[Bronx]], [[Brooklyn]], [[Queens]] and [[Staten Island]]. Situated at the mouth of the [[Hudson River]] in [[New York State]].
# [[Manhattan]].

====Usage notes====
The term {{term||New York City}} can refer to the island of Manhattan alone but most often refers to the entire city. The city’s official name is simply {{term|New York}}, but is referred to as {{term||New York City}} or {{term||New York, New York}} to distinguish it from [[New York State]].

